2026-10-09T12:46:27.4236520Z   PR_BODY_JSON: "Closes #1601\n\nThe trusted artifact reader derives the complete registered role union instead of requiring137 inline/480 total roles. It admits the independently reviewed190+343=533 successor, authenticates whole code/qualification metadata and four explicit entry profiles, and preserves source custody separately from current execution. Historical480 and three-entry533 authorities retain their exact schemas.\n\nThe geography jobs now include their actual trusted coordination import closure. Normal PR/package and combined-tree builds literally target Cloudflare; the separate Site reserve gate is unchanged. This fixes the demonstrated missing-checkout failure and intended build routing, without claiming live-host migration or deployment. The superseded mutable repository-variable draft is not used.\n\nActual controls:18 complete reader tests and56 workflow/adjacent integration tests pass with zero failures/skips. They cover genuine old/new immutable Git metadata, missing/rebound inputs, four-profile/source-policy/operating drift, prospective zero-body-read refusal and actual declared checkout/routing paths. Original343 ordered product joins and512 actual-input/32MiB member/256MiB phase limits remain. No scientific qualification is rerun, selected bank activated, or source uncertainty approved.\n\nEvidence: `coordination/engineering/qualified-artifact-authority-admission-20261009/evidence-quality.json`. Earlier failure and executed-code vintages are retained. Current main's FIFO worker cannot bootstrap its own missing checkout include; any one-time Main-controlled recovery requires independent exact-head review, normal candidate checks and actual combined-tree evidence, and will be recorded explicitly. This PR performs no direct merge or worker bypass. Parent campaign #1202 remains open; Arctic application delivery belongs to #1520.\n"
